ARTWORK ATTRIBUTION

The SVG symbols in this repository are vector reproductions of the Craft Yarn
Council standard knit chart symbols. The Craft Yarn Council permits free use
of their symbols with attribution. If you use the symbols in any publication
or on any website, include the following credit:

  Source: Craft Yarn Council of America's www.YarnStandards.com

For web use:

  Source: Craft Yarn Council <a href="http://www.YarnStandards.com">www.YarnStandards.com</a>
